sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Admin UI (overview page)
    participant D as /api/admin/dashboard
    participant A as /api/admin/assignment-templates
    participant V as /api/admin/assignment-announcements/volatile
    participant S as getAdminDashboardSummary()
    participant T as assignment-template store
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    U->>D: GET dashboard summary
    D->>S: build summary payload
    S->>T: load assignment templates
    T->>DB: fetch assignment-template rows
    DB-->>T: records
    T-->>S: normalized templates + currentAssignmentMeta + enrollmentOnlyLevels
    S->>DB: fetch enrollment + grade/attendance rows
    DB-->>S: records
    S-->>D: { levelCompletion, enrollmentOnlyLevels, currentAssignmentMeta, ... }
    D-->>U: JSON summary

    alt summary.levelCompletion has rows
        U->>U: render bars/buttons from backend rows
    else summary.enrollmentOnlyLevels has rows
        U->>U: render enrollment-only rows from backend summary
    end

    U->>U: render detail panel when level button clicked
    alt assignment metadata present but link missing
        U->>V: POST /api/admin/assignment-announcements/volatile
        V-->>U: preview URL
        U->>U: autofill reminder form from currentAssignmentMeta
    end

    U->>A: GET /api/admin/assignment-templates
